  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We need to have a way to set an animatable parameter that allows us to move our avatars in the x,y,z directions with full motion control and shifting the view position with the avatar. This will be helpful for things like skateboards and some outfits that have different sizes of shoes without them clipping inside the floor. From what I can tell the only way to fix this is by moving the offset manually in blender where your floating if the shoes or items on the feet. Would be nice to be able to spawn a box under my feet and have full locamotion control when on it for performances. If there is a way to do this its not obvious.",
